{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50842","headline":"戏宜春李令求厅前杜鹃 · 卢肇","name":"戏宜春李令求厅前杜鹃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杜家有女小名鹃，生在陶公吏案前。\n百里望风惊调态，千金买笑惬当筵。\n预防户外锄兰地，莫把篱东种菊田。\n爲问河阳妖艳主，聘财却（一作「都」）要几多钱？\n（以上四诗均见《豫章丛书》《袁州二唐人集》中《文标集》卷下。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}